\title{Jorge Vitório Pereira：Holomorphic Foliations with Numerically Trivial Canonical Bundle}
\date{2026-10-12}
\taxon{Reference}
\author{author}

\p{Jorge Vitório Pereira，Holomorphic Foliations with Numerically Trivial Canonical Bundle，Proceedings of the International Congress of Mathematicians 2026，卷 3，第 603 至 618 页。}
\p{[论文集全文](https://epubs.siam.org/doi/10.1137/25M1805813)。第 2 节给出定义，第 3、4 节讨论射影空间与 Poisson 结构，第 5 至 7 节讨论正则性和余维一分类，第 8 节讨论数值平坦切丛及高余维问题。}
